# Residential proxy pool — PLACEHOLDER.
#
# The qwen forward proxy reads this file at /data/proxies.txt inside the
# `qwen` container (see docker-compose.yml) and rotates LRU, oldest-unused
# first, with a forced swap every 4 minutes and on any 429.
# Copy to ./proxies.txt and fill with real entries.
# NEVER commit a filled proxies.txt — it holds host:port:user:pass.
#
# Line format: host:port:user:pass      (text after a `|` is ignored)
# Unparsable and blank lines are skipped. An empty pool is NOT fatal: the
# proxy fails open and uses a direct connection.
#
# --- EXAMPLE (documentation IPs — not a working proxy) ---
198.51.100.10:8000:REPLACE_WITH_USER:REPLACE_WITH_PASS
198.51.100.11:8000:REPLACE_WITH_USER:REPLACE_WITH_PASS